# Plugin: Brainstorming

Purpose:
  Adapt brainstorming skill for SDDRA prompt analysis.

Adaptation:
  Maps three paths to chain types:
    Spike -> P1 (quick analysis)
    Bounded -> D1 (docs generation)
    Architectural -> D1 + S1 (full docs + sdd)

  Approval gate maps to human gates:
    P1->D1: docs approval
    D1->S1: sdd approval
    S1->C1: code approval

Usage:
  Chain: P1, D1
  Trigger: Human submits prompt, classification needed

State: +
